{
  "story_id": "snow-lion",
  "chapter": 3,
  "total_duration_ms": 381912,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Tenzin stayed at the monastery for a week.",
      "start_ms": 1425,
      "end_ms": 3781
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Every morning he did the morning chanting with the monks.",
      "start_ms": 3781,
      "end_ms": 6960
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Every afternoon he helped in the small vegetable garden.",
      "start_ms": 6960,
      "end_ms": 10084
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "He walked with his grandfather along the small paths behind the monastery.",
      "start_ms": 10084,
      "end_ms": 14194
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "They talked, or they did not talk.",
      "start_ms": 14194,
      "end_ms": 16112
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Tenzin thought about the snow lion.",
      "start_ms": 16112,
      "end_ms": 18085
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "He carried it in the pocket of his gho all week.",
      "start_ms": 18085,
      "end_ms": 20771
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "He touched it sometimes without taking it out.",
      "start_ms": 20771,
      "end_ms": 23346
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "It made him feel — different.",
      "start_ms": 23346,
      "end_ms": 24990
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Not exactly joyful.",
      "start_ms": 24990,
      "end_ms": 26086
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "But — connected.",
      "start_ms": 26086,
      "end_ms": 27018
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Connected to all the people who had held it before him.",
      "start_ms": 27018,
      "end_ms": 30087
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Connected to the woman who had carved it four hundred years ago because her son had died.",
      "start_ms": 30087,
      "end_ms": 35019
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Connected to his grandfather.",
      "start_ms": 35019,
      "end_ms": 36664
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Connected to his mother, who had not been given the snow lion but had grown up knowing it existed.",
      "start_ms": 36664,
      "end_ms": 42089
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Connected to all of it.",
      "start_ms": 42089,
      "end_ms": 43459
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "On the last morning, Grandfather Rinpoche walked with Tenzin down to the small path where Tenzin would begin his walk back to the village.",
      "start_ms": 43459,
      "end_ms": 51077
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "They stopped there.",
      "start_ms": 51077,
      "end_ms": 52173
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Grandfather Rinpoche said, \"Tenzin.",
      "start_ms": 52173,
      "end_ms": 54146
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Take good care of the snow lion.",
      "start_ms": 54146,
      "end_ms": 55954
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "When you are old — sometime — you will need to choose who to give it to.",
      "start_ms": 55954,
      "end_ms": 59955
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "That will be up to you.",
      "start_ms": 59955,
      "end_ms": 61270
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "There is no rule.",
      "start_ms": 61270,
      "end_ms": 62257
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "You will know who they are.",
      "start_ms": 62257,
      "end_ms": 63791
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Someone who is serious, and who does not yet know that they are allowed to be joyful.",
      "start_ms": 63791,
      "end_ms": 68504
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Someone who you love very much.",
      "start_ms": 68504,
      "end_ms": 70258
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "Give it to them.",
      "start_ms": 70258,
      "end_ms": 71190
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Then it will keep going.\"",
      "start_ms": 71190,
      "end_ms": 72669
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "\"Grandfather,\" said Tenzin.",
      "start_ms": 72669,
      "end_ms": 74204
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "\"I will not see you again next summer, will I.\" Grandfather Rinpoche was silent.",
      "start_ms": 74204,
      "end_ms": 78643
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Tenzin had said it before he had really thought about it.",
      "start_ms": 78643,
      "end_ms": 81822
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "It had just come out of him.",
      "start_ms": 81822,
      "end_ms": 83411
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "He had not known he had known it.",
      "start_ms": 83411,
      "end_ms": 85274
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "But he had known it.",
      "start_ms": 85274,
      "end_ms": 86425
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "He had seen it in his grandfather's face all week — a small tiredness that had not been there before.",
      "start_ms": 86425,
      "end_ms": 92015
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "A small slowness.",
      "start_ms": 92015,
      "end_ms": 93002
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "A small — finishing quality.",
      "start_ms": 93002,
      "end_ms": 94536
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Grandfather Rinpoche said, quietly, \"I do not think so, Tenzin.",
      "start_ms": 94536,
      "end_ms": 99048
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "My body is tired.",
      "start_ms": 99048,
      "end_ms": 100317
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "I have been here forty-one years.",
      "start_ms": 100317,
      "end_ms": 102713
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "I am seventy-six.",
      "start_ms": 102713,
      "end_ms": 103982
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "I think this was our last summer.",
      "start_ms": 103982,
      "end_ms": 106379
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "I am glad it was a full one.",
      "start_ms": 106379,
      "end_ms": 108423
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "I am glad we had the snow lion between us this week.",
      "start_ms": 108423,
      "end_ms": 112160
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "That is why I gave it to you now, and not later.",
      "start_ms": 112160,
      "end_ms": 115614
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "I wanted to give it to you myself.",
      "start_ms": 115614,
      "end_ms": 118081
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "I wanted to see you take it.\"",
      "start_ms": 118081,
      "end_ms": 120266
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Tenzin was crying now.",
      "start_ms": 120266,
      "end_ms": 121888
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "He was not making sounds.",
      "start_ms": 121888,
      "end_ms": 123721
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "He was just crying.",
      "start_ms": 123721,
      "end_ms": 125131
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Grandfather Rinpoche did not try to stop him.",
      "start_ms": 125131,
      "end_ms": 128373
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "He put his hand on Tenzin's shoulder.",
      "start_ms": 128373,
      "end_ms": 131052
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "He said, \"Tenzin.",
      "start_ms": 131052,
      "end_ms": 132321
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Listen.",
      "start_ms": 132321,
      "end_ms": 132885
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "This is very important.",
      "start_ms": 132885,
      "end_ms": 134577
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "When I die — and it will probably be sometime this winter — I want you to know that I am not sad.",
      "start_ms": 134577,
      "end_ms": 141485
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "I am ready.",
      "start_ms": 141485,
      "end_ms": 142331
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "I have had a very good life.",
      "start_ms": 142331,
      "end_ms": 144376
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "I have had a wife I loved.",
      "start_ms": 144376,
      "end_ms": 146279
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "A daughter I love.",
      "start_ms": 146279,
      "end_ms": 147618
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "A grandson I love.",
      "start_ms": 147618,
      "end_ms": 148958
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Forty-one years in a place I love.",
      "start_ms": 148958,
      "end_ms": 151425
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "That is a full life.",
      "start_ms": 151425,
      "end_ms": 152905
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "When you hear that I have died, I want you to take the snow lion in your palm, and I want you to remember what I have told you.",
      "start_ms": 152905,
      "end_ms": 161929
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "That I was happy here.",
      "start_ms": 161929,
      "end_ms": 163550
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "That I am happy now.",
      "start_ms": 163550,
      "end_ms": 165030
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "That there is joy on the other side of the leaving.",
      "start_ms": 165030,
      "end_ms": 168696
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Not just sadness.",
      "start_ms": 168696,
      "end_ms": 169965
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Joy too.",
      "start_ms": 169965,
      "end_ms": 170599
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Yes?\" Tenzin nodded.",
      "start_ms": 170599,
      "end_ms": 172080
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "He could not speak.",
      "start_ms": 172080,
      "end_ms": 173490
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Grandfather Rinpoche said, \"Now go.",
      "start_ms": 173490,
      "end_ms": 176027
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Walk carefully.",
      "start_ms": 176027,
      "end_ms": 177155
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Say hello to your mother.",
      "start_ms": 177155,
      "end_ms": 178988
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Say I loved her every single day.\"",
      "start_ms": 178988,
      "end_ms": 181526
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Tenzin turned.",
      "start_ms": 181526,
      "end_ms": 182583
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "He walked down the path.",
      "start_ms": 182583,
      "end_ms": 184346
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "He walked for a long time.",
      "start_ms": 184346,
      "end_ms": 186249
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "When he had gone maybe a kilometer, he looked back one last time.",
      "start_ms": 186249,
      "end_ms": 190902
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Grandfather Rinpoche was still standing at the top of the path.",
      "start_ms": 190902,
      "end_ms": 195413
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "He raised his hand.",
      "start_ms": 195413,
      "end_ms": 196823
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "Tenzin raised his hand.",
      "start_ms": 196823,
      "end_ms": 198515
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Grandfather Rinpoche turned and walked back to the monastery.",
      "start_ms": 198515,
      "end_ms": 202886
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Tenzin watched him go.",
      "start_ms": 202886,
      "end_ms": 204507
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "Then he turned and he walked down.",
      "start_ms": 204507,
      "end_ms": 206904
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Grandfather Rinpoche died in November, four months later.",
      "start_ms": 206904,
      "end_ms": 210600
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "A monk walked down from the high monastery to bring the message.",
      "start_ms": 210600,
      "end_ms": 214741
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "He arrived at Tenzin's house in the evening.",
      "start_ms": 214741,
      "end_ms": 217608
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Tenzin's mother opened the door.",
      "start_ms": 217608,
      "end_ms": 219711
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "She knew from the monk's face what he had come to say.",
      "start_ms": 219711,
      "end_ms": 223215
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "She let him in.",
      "start_ms": 223215,
      "end_ms": 224235
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "He sat with them.",
      "start_ms": 224235,
      "end_ms": 225382
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "He told them the news.",
      "start_ms": 225382,
      "end_ms": 226847
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "Grandfather Rinpoche had died in his sleep.",
      "start_ms": 226847,
      "end_ms": 229651
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "He had been ill for two weeks.",
      "start_ms": 229651,
      "end_ms": 231626
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "He had asked, before he died, that a message be sent down.",
      "start_ms": 231626,
      "end_ms": 235385
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "He had asked that the message say specifically to Tenzin — I am happy.",
      "start_ms": 235385,
      "end_ms": 239909
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "Remember what I told you.",
      "start_ms": 239909,
      "end_ms": 241630
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Tenzin took the small snow lion out of the pocket of his gho, where he had been keeping it.",
      "start_ms": 241630,
      "end_ms": 247491
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "He held it in his palm.",
      "start_ms": 247491,
      "end_ms": 249021
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "He sat by the small stove.",
      "start_ms": 249021,
      "end_ms": 250741
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "His mother sat beside him.",
      "start_ms": 250741,
      "end_ms": 252461
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "She put her arm around him.",
      "start_ms": 252461,
      "end_ms": 254245
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "He cried for a long time.",
      "start_ms": 254245,
      "end_ms": 255902
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "But he also held the snow lion, and he thought about his grandfather at the monastery, happy in the silence and the snow.",
      "start_ms": 255902,
      "end_ms": 263675
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "He thought about the great-great-great-grandmother four hundred years ago, carving joy out of the hardest wood she could find, in the winter her son died.",
      "start_ms": 263675,
      "end_ms": 273552
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "He thought — she was right.",
      "start_ms": 273552,
      "end_ms": 275336
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "She was right that both are possible at once.",
      "start_ms": 275336,
      "end_ms": 278267
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Grief and joy.",
      "start_ms": 278267,
      "end_ms": 279222
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Both.",
      "start_ms": 279222,
      "end_ms": 279605
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "Grandfather was right too.",
      "start_ms": 279605,
      "end_ms": 281325
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "He said, quietly, to himself, and to the small snow lion in his palm, \"I remember, Grandfather.",
      "start_ms": 281325,
      "end_ms": 287442
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "I remember.\"",
      "start_ms": 287442,
      "end_ms": 288334
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Tenzin kept the snow lion for the rest of his life.",
      "start_ms": 288334,
      "end_ms": 291647
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "He carried it everywhere for years.",
      "start_ms": 291647,
      "end_ms": 293941
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "When he was grown, and had a family of his own, he still kept it on a small shelf in his home in the Bumthang valley.",
      "start_ms": 293941,
      "end_ms": 301459
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "He looked at it often.",
      "start_ms": 301459,
      "end_ms": 302925
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "When his children were small he told them the story of it — about the great-great-great-grandmother, about the son who had died, about Grandfather Rinpoche at the high monastery.",
      "start_ms": 302925,
      "end_ms": 314330
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "His children listened.",
      "start_ms": 314330,
      "end_ms": 315796
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "He watched them, over the years, to see if any of them was — the right person.",
      "start_ms": 315796,
      "end_ms": 320829
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "He was not sure.",
      "start_ms": 320829,
      "end_ms": 321912
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "He thought maybe his oldest daughter.",
      "start_ms": 321912,
      "end_ms": 324334
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "He was not sure yet.",
      "start_ms": 324334,
      "end_ms": 325608
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "When Tenzin was forty-two he had a small niece who came to visit for a summer — his sister's child.",
      "start_ms": 325608,
      "end_ms": 331617
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "She was ten.",
      "start_ms": 331617,
      "end_ms": 332398
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "She was a very serious girl.",
      "start_ms": 332398,
      "end_ms": 334141
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "Tenzin watched her for a week.",
      "start_ms": 334141,
      "end_ms": 336004
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "He saw — he saw exactly what his mother had seen in him, and what his grandmother had seen in his grandfather.",
      "start_ms": 336004,
      "end_ms": 342673
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "A serious child who did not yet know she was allowed to be joyful.",
      "start_ms": 342673,
      "end_ms": 346699
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "On the last evening of her visit, Tenzin brought the snow lion out.",
      "start_ms": 346699,
      "end_ms": 350786
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "He unwrapped it.",
      "start_ms": 350786,
      "end_ms": 351807
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "He put it in his niece's hand.",
      "start_ms": 351807,
      "end_ms": 353670
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "He told her the story — from the beginning, the four hundred years, all of it.",
      "start_ms": 353670,
      "end_ms": 358417
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "He said, \"This is yours now.",
      "start_ms": 358417,
      "end_ms": 360160
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Take good care of it.",
      "start_ms": 360160,
      "end_ms": 361482
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "Someday you will give it to a serious child in the family.",
      "start_ms": 361482,
      "end_ms": 365027
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "You will know who.",
      "start_ms": 365027,
      "end_ms": 366169
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "And it will keep going.\" His niece held the snow lion in both hands.",
      "start_ms": 366169,
      "end_ms": 370315
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "She was quiet.",
      "start_ms": 370315,
      "end_ms": 371216
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "She said, \"Uncle.",
      "start_ms": 371216,
      "end_ms": 372298
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "Thank you.\" And Tenzin was — for that moment — very much like his grandfather, on the day he had given away the snow lion.",
      "start_ms": 372298,
      "end_ms": 379689
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "Grateful.",
      "start_ms": 379689,
      "end_ms": 380290
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Tired.",
      "start_ms": 380290,
      "end_ms": 380710
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Joyful.",
      "start_ms": 380710,
      "end_ms": 381191
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "All at once.",
      "start_ms": 381191,
      "end_ms": 381912
    }
  ]
}